  "details": "Since last build 928, i noticed something bit weird effect with VRChat menu.\nVRChat menu opening itself is okay. The World tab is okay (that is because it's not very active) but if i go to Social tab, i noticed my fps is not more smooth, it has some spikes. This is because Social tab is more active and is asking time to time new data from server.\nRequesting data actively in Social tab causes some spikes. I noticed when i want look around while Social tab is open, or want move through the friends. It's not more smooth. The small spikes have approx. 3 sec timespan i think. \nYes, its constantly spiking, i can see it. You will notice it more when world is very busy.\n\nThe build earlier is more smoother than last build 928, i think.\n\nClosing VRChat menu or leaving Social tab turns the fps back to normal, more smooth fps.\nMight take a look into it, because earlier builds i didn't notice very much spiking.",
